# Cursor + gstack workflow

gstack skills are installed globally under `~/.cursor/skills/gstack-*`.

## When to use which gstack skill

- **Plan before large work**: use `gstack-office-hours` and then `gstack-autoplan`
- **Architecture review**: use `gstack-plan-eng-review` (before implementation) or `gstack-review` (after)
- **Security review**: use `gstack-cso` for security-sensitive changes (auth, secrets, supply chain, CI/CD)
- **Ship a PR**: use `gstack-ship` once changes are ready

## Branch + commit rules (enforced)

- **Never commit to `main`** (see `no-commit-to-main.mdc`)
- **Use Conventional Commits** (see `conventional-commits.mdc`)

